{"text": "Texas Pregnancy Care Network\n450 Sikes Road\nBellville TX 77418\nApril 16, 2006\n\nTPCN2-30 Project Work Plan\nACTIVITY START\nFY 2006 Activities\n\nDeploy RAPID Billing System March 20, 2006\n\nCOMPLETE\n\nJune 3, 2006\n\nReal Alternatives Program and Instructional Design (RAPID) is a system of software,\nforms and training which guides the screening and approval of Texas Service providers,\nthe training of their personnel, and the documentation and reporting of their client service\nactivities. Its deployment consists of hardware and software installation and TPCN\npersonnel training. Initializing the RAPID database will make it available for use.\n\nDatabase Initialization\n\nTPCN Personnel Hiring\n\nJune 5, 2006\n\nThe positions to be filled are: Executive Director, Accountant, Administrative Assistant,\ntwo Training and Evaluation managers, and a Quality Control Manager.\n\nExecutive Director Job ads placed March 20, 2006\nExecutive Director candidate interviews April 12, 2006\nExecutive Director hired, initial training April 28, 2006\n\nOther TPCN positions, job ads placed\nInterviews\nHired, initial training\n\nApril 17, 2006\nMay 8, 2006\nMay 30, 2006\n\nTPCN staff training at Real Alternatives June 5, 2006\n\nMarch 24, 2006\nApril 20, 2006\nMay 10, 2006\n\nMay 1, 2006\nMay 19, 2006\nJune 2, 2006\n\nJune 17, 2006\n\nIn intensive two-week training, staff will be oriented to RAPID, then taught the specific\nduties and responsibilities of their positions by their Real Alternatives counterparts.\n\nService Provider (SP) Start-up\n\nService Providers (social service agencies, pregnancy centers, maternity homes and\nadoption agencies) will be solicited, screened, contracted with, and trained in how to\n\ncomply with program requirements and reporting activities.\n\nLetters to candidate Service Providers = April 3, 2006\nEvaluation checklist to responders April 24, 2006\nSix City Q&A Sessions for potential SP\u2019s June 19, 2006\nSP Review and Approval June 26, 2006\nSP Personnel Program Training August 8, 2006\nSp Ongoing Approval August 16, 2006\n\nDecember 3, 2008\n\nApril 7, 2006\nMay 5, 2006\nJune 23, 2006\nAugust 7, 2006\nAugust 16, 2006\nAugust 31, 2006",
